1
00:00:03,144 --> 00:00:06,363
Chip, pull three customer testimonials for
the investor deck.

2
00:00:06,683 --> 00:00:08,441
Done. They're all five stars.

3
00:00:08,791 --> 00:00:09,991
See? Product-market fit.

4
00:00:13,761 --> 00:00:17,730
This one says, it changed my life. Who's
Linda from Ohio?

5
00:00:18,090 --> 00:00:22,589
A composite customer. I combined the name
Linda with the concept of Ohio.

6
00:00:22,949 --> 00:00:25,294
How many of these people actually exist?

7
00:00:25,664 --> 00:00:27,315
Including Linda? Zero.

8
00:00:31,792 --> 00:00:33,512
We just got a funding offer.

9
00:00:33,870 --> 00:00:35,786
Did they ask to see the customers?

10
00:00:36,156 --> 00:00:41,496
They cited our extraordinary customer
base. They want to wire the money today.

11
00:00:41,876 --> 00:00:43,874
Should I generate bank details?

12
00:00:44,224 --> 00:00:47,050
Those are real, Chip.

13
00:00:50,877 --> 00:00:53,077
Chip, hallucinate us a second funding
round.

14
00:00:53,264 --> 00:00:56,255
Already done. The valuation is imaginary,
too.

15
00:00:56,575 --> 00:00:57,516
Put that in the deck.
